      "reasoning": "The request only provides a sanitized tab key via sanitize_key($_REQUEST['tab']). Kubio then looks up that key in kubio_get_started_page_tabs() and uses the mapped tab-partial value. The request does not flow directly into require_once; exploitation would require a trusted filter to inject a malicious tab definition first."
    },
    {
      "finding_id": "KUBIO-P2-NEG-003",
      "verdict": "FP",
      "summary": "Contact-form and newsletter shortcode XSS candidates are neutralized by kses/context escaping before output.",
      "evidence": [
        "plugins/kubio/lib/shortcodes/contact-form/index.php:40-72",
        "plugins/kubio/lib/shortcodes/subscribe-form/subscribe-form.php:41-87",
        "plugins/kubio/lib/shortcodes/subscribe-form/subscribe-form.php:93-115"
      ],
      "reasoning": "The contact-form shortcode runs wp_kses_post() on the embedded shortcode string before do_shortcode(), and the newsletter renderer escapes labels/placeholders with esc_html/esc_attr while wrapping rich label text in wp_kses_post(). I did not find an unescaped attribute/body sink reachable directly from shortcode attributes."
    },
    {
      "finding_id": "KUBIO-P2-NEG-004",
      "verdict": "FP",
      "summary": "The Image Hub plugin installer is capability-gated correctly.",
      "evidence": [
        "plugins/kubio/lib/integrations/image-hub/image-hub.php:66-75"
      ],
      "reasoning": "The AJAX handler verifies the kubio_ajax_nonce and immediately enforces current_user_can('install_plugins') before invoking PluginsManager::installPlugin() or activatePlugin()."
    },
    {
      "finding_id": "KUBIO-P2-NEG-005",
      "verdict": "FP",
      "summary": "Preview changeset deletion enforces both nonce validation and ownership.",
      "evidence": [
        "plugins/kubio/lib/preview/index.php:171-180"
      ],
      "reasoning": "kubio-delete-changeset requires a valid kubio_ajax_nonce, resolves the changeset by UUID, and only deletes when the changeset post_author matches get_current_user_id(). I did not find cross-user deletion."
    },
    {
      "finding_id": "KUBIO-P2-NEG-006",
      "verdict": "FP",
      "summary": "Most high-value REST mutation surfaces flagged in Phase 1 are admin-gated in live code.",
      "evidence": [
