+        }
+      ],
+      "reasoning": {
+        "hypothesis": "The public trigger-button surface might let arbitrary visitors execute privileged actions or abuse the pre-nonce do_action() call.",
+        "trace": "The shortcode intentionally exposes a trigger form. The AJAX endpoint validates the shortcode nonce at functions.php:278-280 and then emits st_trigger_button_action at functions.php:301, which the bundled trigger integration consumes as the user-click trigger.",
+        "defenses": "The feature is intentionally public when the site owner embeds the shortcode. The in-plugin sink is the automation trigger path itself, not an option write, file operation, or privileged admin mutation. The public redirect values are returned through esc_url_raw().",
